    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1977945623954588007",
      "url": "https://x.com/PilipinasToday_/status/1977945623954588007",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PilipinasToday_/status/1977945623954588007",
      "text": "Bumanat si Atty. Jesus Falcis sa mga Diehard Duterte Supporters (DDS) na nakiisa sa 'anti-Marcos rally' ni Cavite 4th District Rep. Kiko Barzaga sa Forbes Park nitong Linggo, Oktubre 13.\n\n“The irony of most of them going to Forbes Park through Angkas or motorcycles but the Congressmeow they support came and left in a car with a driver and security,” saad ni Falcis.\n\n“Good job daw kahit: (1) late siya dumating (2) mali ‘yung unang pinuntahan niya because akala niya ang Dasmariñas Village entrance sa EDSA ay pareho sa Forbes Park entrance (3) hindi niya napasok ang Forbes Park kahit ‘yun ang goal niya dahil ang pera daw ng taumbayan ay nasa loob,” dagdag pa niya.\n\n#PilipinasToday\n#JesusFalcis\n#KikoBarzaga\n#DDS",
